@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：管理員審核書籍與處理檢舉

actor 管理員 as Admin
participant "AdminBookScreen /\nAdminReportScreen" as UI
participant "ApiService\n(AdminCommerceApi)" as ApiSvc
participant "GET /admin/ai/reviews" as ListRoute
participant "PATCH /admin/ai/reviews/:id" as DecideRoute
participant "ai/reviews.js" as ReviewsSvc
participant "PATCH /admin/content/books/:id" as ReportRoute
participant "reports.js" as ReportsSvc
participant "requireAdmin中介層" as Guard
database "Prisma / MariaDB" as DB

Admin -> UI : 開啟「AI待審書籍」佇列
UI -> ApiSvc : fetchAiReviews()
ApiSvc -> Guard : requireAdmin('can_manage_content')
Guard -> ListRoute : 通過
ListRoute -> ReviewsSvc : adminList('pending')
ReviewsSvc -> DB : 查詢 ai_book_reviews + 書籍卡片
ReviewsSvc --> UI : 待審清單（含AI判定理由）

Admin -> UI : 選擇「核准」或「駁回」
UI -> ApiSvc : decideAiReview(bookId, decision, note)
ApiSvc -> DecideRoute : PATCH /admin/ai/reviews/:id
DecideRoute -> ReviewsSvc : decide(bookId, {decision, note}, admin)
alt decision = approve
  ReviewsSvc -> DB : books.update(is_approved=true)\n（若原removed則恢復on_sale）
  ReviewsSvc -> DB : ai_book_reviews.status='approved'
else decision = reject
  ReviewsSvc -> DB : books.update(is_approved=false)\n（若原on_sale則轉removed）
  ReviewsSvc -> DB : ai_book_reviews.status='rejected'
end
ReviewsSvc -> DB : notify 賣家 + audit.record()
ReviewsSvc --> UI : 200 完成

== 檢舉處理 ==
Admin -> UI : 開啟檢舉列表
UI -> ApiSvc : fetchAdminReports()
ApiSvc -> ReportRoute : GET /admin/moderation/reports
ReportRoute -> ReportsSvc : list(filter)
ReportsSvc --> UI : 檢舉案件列表

Admin -> UI : 標記檢舉為「成立」並處置
UI -> ApiSvc : resolveReport(reportId, status='resolved')
ApiSvc -> ReportRoute : PATCH /admin/moderation/reports/:id
ReportRoute -> ReportsSvc : resolve(reportId, admin)
ReportsSvc -> DB : reports.update(status='resolved')
note right
  status='resolved' 之檢舉
  會使該書進入 violationLocked，
  賣家無法自行重新上架，
  須管理員或AI複核處理。
end note
ReportsSvc --> UI : 200 完成
@enduml
